    "regime_notes": "Overall daily IC and ICIR pass the benchmark gates. Elevated-dispersion observations cover roughly half the date-instrument observations; small 15-asset cross-section warrants conservative interpretation. Regime subgroup diagnostics were not reported because zero signals on inactive dates can produce constant cross-sections; do not treat this as evidence of regime uniformity.",
